    "reading-passage": {
      "nodeId": "544:1109",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "📖 Reading Passage",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "📖 Reading Passage"
        },
        {
          "text": "Level: B1 · Topic: The Sports Center",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "Level: B1 · Topic: The Sports Center"
        },
        {
          "text": "Joining the Sports Center\n\nI recently joined a sports centre near my home. I go there three times a week to stay fit and healthy.\n\nThe sports centre is a large modern building with many facilities. On the ground floor, there is a reception desk where members check in with their membership card. Next to it, there are changing rooms with lockers, showers, and benches.\n\nThe main area has a gym with exercise machines: treadmills for running, exercise bikes for cycling, rowing machines, and weight machines. There is also a free weights section with dumbbells, barbells, and kettlebells. A personal trainer is available to help beginners with their form.\n\nUpstairs, there is a large indoor swimming pool with lanes for lap swimming. Next to the pool, there is a sauna and a steam room. The pool has a lifeguard on duty during all opening hours.\n\nThe centre also has courts for basketball, badminton, and tennis. You can book a court at the reception desk for one hour at a time. There is a football pitch outside and a running track around it.\n\nGroup classes are very popular. The timetable includes yoga, aerobics, spinning, and martial arts. I usually attend the yoga class on Tuesday evenings — it helps me relax after work.\n\nMembership costs fifty pounds a month, and students get a discount. The sports centre has become an important part of my routine.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "Joining the Sports Center I recently joined a sports centre near my home. I go there three times a week to stay fit and healthy. The sports centre is a large modern building with many facilities. On the ground floor, there is a reception desk where members check in with their membership card. Next to it, there are changing rooms with lockers, showers, and benches. The main area has a gym with exercise machines: treadmills for running, exercise bikes for cycling, rowing machines, and weight machines. There is also a free weights section with dumbbells, barbells, and kettlebells. A personal trainer is available to help beginners with their form. Upstairs, there is a large indoor swimming pool with lanes for lap swimming. Next to the pool, there is a sauna and a steam room. The pool has a lifeguard on duty during all opening hours. The centre also has courts for basketball, badminton, and tennis. You can book a court at the reception desk for one hour at a time. There is a football pitch outside and a running track around it. Group classes are very popular. The timetable includes yoga, aerobics, spinning, and martial arts. I usually attend the yoga class on Tuesday evenings — it helps me relax after work. Membership costs fifty pounds a month, and students get a discount. The sports centre has become an important part of my routine."
        },
        {
          "text": "Comprehension Questions",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "Comprehension Questions"
        },
        {
          "text": "1. How often does the writer go to the sports centre?",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "1. How often does the writer go to the sports centre?"
        },
        {
          "text": "2. What exercise machines are in the gym?",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "2. What exercise machines are in the gym?"
        },
        {
          "text": "3. What facilities are near the swimming pool?",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "3. What facilities are near the swimming pool?"
        },
        {
          "text": "4. How can you book a court?",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "4. How can you book a court?"
        },
        {
          "text": "5. What group class does the writer attend?",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "5. What group class does the writer attend?"
        }
      ]
    },
    "idioms-phrases": {
      "nodeId": "544:1122",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "💬 Idioms, Phrasal Verbs & Key Phrases",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "💬 Idioms, Phrasal Verbs & Key Phrases"
        },
        {
          "text": "work out",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "work out"
        },
        {
          "text": "exercise; also: find a solution",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "exercise; also: find a solution"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"I work out at the gym three times a week.\"",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "\"I work out at the gym three times a week.\""
        },
        {
          "text": "warm up / cool down",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "warm up / cool down"
        },
        {
          "text": "prepare your body before / after exercise",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "prepare your body before / after exercise"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Always warm up before you start lifting weights.\"",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "\"Always warm up before you start lifting weights.\""
        },
        {
          "text": "keep fit",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "keep fit"
        },
        {
          "text": "maintain good physical health",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "maintain good physical health"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"She goes swimming every morning to keep fit.\"",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "\"She goes swimming every morning to keep fit.\""
        },
        {
          "text": "get in shape",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "get in shape"
        },
        {
          "text": "improve your fitness level",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "improve your fitness level"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"I need to get in shape before the summer.\"",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "\"I need to get in shape before the summer.\""
        },
        {
          "text": "push yourself",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "push yourself"
        },
        {
          "text": "try harder, go beyond your comfort zone",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "try harder, go beyond your comfort zone"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The trainer told me to push myself during the last set.\"",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "\"The trainer told me to push myself during the last set.\""
        },
        {
          "text": "hit the gym",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "hit the gym"
        },
        {
          "text": "go to the gym (informal)",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "go to the gym (informal)"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"I'm going to hit the gym after work today.\"",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "\"I'm going to hit the gym after work today.\""
        },
        {
          "text": "run out of steam",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "run out of steam"
        },
        {
          "text": "lose energy or motivation",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "lose energy or motivation"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"I ran out of steam after 30 minutes on the treadmill.\"",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "\"I ran out of steam after 30 minutes on the treadmill.\""
        },
        {
